</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="configuration" aria-labelledby="configuration-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Configuration</p>
				<h2 id="configuration-heading">Register with Digest authentication, then choose how each DID routes.</h2>
				<p class="lede">The endpoint must register to the LAN address of the SDN appliance using Digest authentication. Routing of a DID can be one of the following: <strong>User</strong> sends the call to the account username; <strong>SDN</strong> sends the call to the DID number.</p>
			</div>
